---
description: Mandatory automated work orders, backups and evidence for every coding task
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AI_WORKFLOW.md` and `AGENTS.md` before acting.

Before editing, run:

```bash
bash tools/llm-workflow.sh status
bash tools/llm-workflow.sh start --agent cursor --objective "<objective>"
```

Use `--structural` when appropriate. Record findings and validations through the workflow script, never use `--no-verify`, and always finish or abort. Commit, push and merge require express user authorization.
